MLOps Project End‑to‑End Pipeline – Final Report

Project Summary
----------------
The repository implements a complete MLOps lifecycle for a real‑estate price prediction use case. The pipeline covers data ingestion, validation, feature engineering, model training, evaluation, registration, deployment and monitoring. Prefect orchestrates the stages, MLflow provides experiment tracking and model registry, FastAPI serves the model, Prometheus scrapes operational metrics and Grafana visualises them.

Implemented Components
----------------------
- Configuration loader with validation (`src/config_loader.py`).
- Prefect pipeline (`src/pipeline.py`).
- Stage modules (`src/stages/*`).
- Serving API with Prometheus metrics (`src/serving/app.py`).
- Dockerfile and `docker-compose.yml` for app, MLflow, Prometheus, Grafana.
- Test suite (`tests/*`).
- CI workflow (`.github/workflows/ci.yml`).
- Release workflow (`.github/workflows/release.yml`).
- README with setup and Grafana instructions.

Missing / Open Items
--------------------
- Rollback documentation – added as `ROLLBACK.md`.
- Data‑drift monitoring – `src/stages/monitor.py` needs Evidently integration.
- Dashboard JSON – provided for manual import.
- Demo video – record a short video of the full loop.
- Release tagging – ensure tags follow `vX.Y.Z` and trigger the release workflow.

